# Atlas Core Component Tokens & Zero-Runtime Spec
**Author:** Prism Nkosi  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D17 23:30  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Compiled design token architecture for Atlas Core, engineered for zero-runtime overhead and microsecond CSS variable resolution. Token scales and accessibility constraints directly incorporate branding and operational standards defined in the Company Document.

